[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_04_0010","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_04_0020","text":"呼姆……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_04_0030","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_04_0040","text":"……？\n啊哈，怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_04_0050","text":"小咲的镜头，一直在瞄准三峰呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_04_0060","text":"认真工作的侧脸，实在太过美丽了\n不由得就举起了相机"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_04_0070","text":"美丽～？\n就算夸我也不会给你什么好处哦～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_04_0080","text":"没有好处也无妨\n只要你能允许我这样拍下去"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_04_0090","text":"那个，好玩吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_04_0100","text":"当然"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_04_0001","text":"Motion"}]
